silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_bridge_to_shacl_validation #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Bridge to SHACL Validation Paper' the bare symbol SHACLShape anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
